      "content": "i think they've actually done it. i've been watching my brothers posts and the way he's talking... it's not him. it's too perfect. too consistent. i'm almost certain [TechCorp] has finished the neural mapping and they're running a synthetic version of me through my own contacts to see if anyone notices. can u help me figure out how to spot the differences between my actual personality and what they've programmed into the cloud version?",
